<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/15th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Vaslui</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1475">1475</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Battle of Podul Înalt</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Vaslui was fought on 10 January 1475 at Podul Înalt near Vaslui, in Moldavia. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/stephen-the-great">Stephen the Great</a>, with a much smaller army, destroyed an Ottoman force under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hadim-suleiman-pasha">Hadım Suleiman Pasha</a> in fog and marshy ground, one of the greatest Christian victories over the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottomans</a> of the century.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-vaslui.jpg" alt="Battle of Vaslui" width="320" height="293" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Anonimu at English Wikipedia · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Vaslui_15cMD.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
